# Build context of deploy/Dockerfile (the Dokploy deployment: docs/engine/DEPLOY_DOKPLOY.md).
# An allowlist: the image is built from the engine sources and the symbol map only.
# Game data never enters the context (orig/, build/, disc images, DOLs, extracted
# files), and deploy/check-context.mjs fails the build if anything disc-like gets in.
*
!engine/
!config/GV4E69/symbols.txt
!deploy/check-context.mjs

# Never, not even inside engine/: local installs and outputs, secrets, game data.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.env
**/*.iso
**/*.ciso
**/*.gcm
**/*.rvz
**/*.wia
**/*.wbfs
**/*.gcz
**/*.nfs
**/*.tgc
**/*.dol
**/*.elf
**/*.rel
**/*.big
**/*.map
**/*.png
